y i would like not  have water not have coffee like be  careful right fortunately his co-star  brian tyree henry let him in on a  helpful secret and he said there's a  zipper  this was the moment he figured out those  pants were on the wrong way anyone else  get totally caught in the brilliant  visuals of the bollywood magic happening  in eternals this scene was a dream come  true for the designer sarancoli who  literally tripped while on the phone  when discovering he'd gotten the gig on  this epic marvel movie excited to share  his bollywood style and represent south  asians saron was responsible for  designing the costumes for all 52  dancers we see in the scene and he  helped out with kumails as well  [Music]  never thought she'd be playing a  superhero and even almost completely  passed on eternals because she was  worried they'd want her to play  someone's grandmother  while she was excited by the whole  experience she didn't feel too eager to  try on her superhero outfit i'm  claustrophobic i was terrified of the  costume luckily once she actually had it  on any fear of claustrophobia or  overwhelm melted away i found myself  profoundly moved and it shows through  her performance costume designer sami  sheldon differ had it right when she  said hayek looked like the ceo of the  universe in her costume when some eager  fans caught a peek of what was going on  behind the scenes of eternals a rumor  went around that jolie had gone blonde  for the movie and she did except there  was no hair dye in sight jolie's wig had  an impressive team behind it gretchen  evans made the base another hair stylist  blaine dowling was responsible for  getting the color just right and academy  award winner adruthalee made it camera  perfect styling on point but like you're  like oh you know it's a it's quite hard  to move in barry kilgan might have  wished his costume actually was cgi  since the actor constantly felt  overwhelmed by his outfits and all three  layers they came with