ed at the  red carpet and i started seeing  all these people dressed as us she was  emotional seeing herself in her ajax  costume for the first time but what  really got salma hayek in the feels was  seeing so many people dressed up as  their characters at the premiere i  wanted to cry one family in particular  really moved the actress the father then  the mother was dressed they were latinos  as ajax and the three little daughters  also like ajax we can't blame kumail for  having trouble with his superhero suit  hopefully he can help future marvel  actors figure out how to be able to go  to the washroom in their costumes


